atlas external

architecture foreign-twin
  canonical_name ForeignTwinGraph
  family external
  domain External
  layer external
  semantic_question What is the current cached projection of an externally-owned resource, and what rights do we hold over it?
  purpose Remote stays remote. A content-addressed cached projection with rights observe/reference/bind/act. Materialize ingests the projection into the fabric.
  maturity measured
  node_types ForeignTwin
  node_types Projection
  edge_types projects
  edge_types materializes_to
  state_types observe
  state_types reference
  state_types bind
  state_types act
  invariant a cached projection is not remote truth
  forbidden_inference foreign twin cache -> remote authority
  forbidden_inference observe right -> bind or act right
  computational_form durable
  native_format graf
  command BonfyreProject
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/foreign.py
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/fabric_publish.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_foreign.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_fabric_publish.py
  source_lineage external boundary architecture

architecture service-lifecycle
  canonical_name ServiceLifecycleGraph
  family external
  domain External / Service
  layer external/service
  semantic_question Where is a provisionable service in its lifecycle, and what may we do with it now?
  purpose OSB-shaped catalog -> provision -> bind -> execute -> release over the real BonfyreAPI. Shared lifecycle mechanics do not erase concrete protocols (OSB, GPU lease, human assignment).
  maturity implemented
  node_types ServiceProfile
  node_types ServiceInstance
  edge_types provisions
  edge_types binds
  state_types cataloged
  state_types provisioned
  state_types bound
  state_types released
  invariant bind requires the bind right; release is idempotent
  forbidden_inference service active -> bind authority
  computational_form durable
  command BonfyreAPI
  source_path 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/service_lifecycle.py
  witness 10-Code/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_service_lifecycle.py
  source_lineage OSB / ServiceLifecycle architecture

architecture partner-commons
  canonical_name PartnerCommons
  family external
  domain External / Institutions
  layer external/relationship
  semantic_question What narrow specialty and observed relationship state does a partner contribute without taking Bonfyre semantic ownership?
  purpose Typed partner profiles plus append-only source-backed observations. Each profile states its boundary contribution and what it does not own; observations project to rights-limited ForeignTwins and EvidenceGraph claims.
  maturity implemented
  node_types PartnerProfile
  node_types PartnerObservation
  edge_types contributes_to
  edge_types observed_as
  invariant every profile states explicit semantic non-ownership
  invariant every observation carries a source reference and observation time
  forbidden_inference a maintainer interaction -> authority to mutate the partner institution
  forbidden_inference a partner specialty -> ownership of the connected Bonfyre organ
  computational_form durable
  native_format crux
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/partner_commons.py
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_partner_commons.py
  source_lineage Generation-10 V8.1 Partner Commons plus Run 6/7 relationship state
  known_gap live refresh remains a bounded external observation effect; the stored latest row is never remote truth

architecture result-receipt-bundle
  canonical_name ResultReceiptBundleGraph
  family external
  domain External / Attestation
  layer external/attestation
  semantic_question Does this worker submission's portable bundle verify offline, byte for byte?
  purpose The portable unit of trust: patch, gate results, task ref, sandbox selection, worker key, DSSE-signed attestation, chain-linked. Offline field-level verify. Contributed upstream (bernstein #3870).
  maturity measured
  node_types ResultBundle
  node_types GateResult
  node_types ChainLink
  edge_types attests
  edge_types chains_to
  invariant tampering any byte of the patch or a gate log fails verification with a field-level error
  invariant verification is offline and side-effect free
  forbidden_inference embedded worker key -> pinned provenance (requires an out-of-band roster)
  native_format crux
  source_path external:sipyourdrink-ltd/bernstein/src/bernstein/core/security/result_receipt_bundle.py
  witness external:bernstein tests/unit/security/test_result_receipt_bundle.py (9 tests)
  source_lineage bernstein volunteer umbrella #3863 issue #3870

architecture blogger-publication-surface
  canonical_name BloggerPublicationSurface
  family external
  domain External / Publication
  layer external/surface
  semantic_question Which source-backed Bonfyre artifact was published to which Blogger URL, under what authority, and with which safe API receipt?
  purpose Blogger is a bounded External CMS realization: proof-bundled HTML crosses an authorized effect boundary, while the returned post identity, status, timestamps, and URL become occurrence and evidence records.
  maturity implemented
  node_types PublicationArtifact
  node_types BloggerPost
  node_types BloggerReceipt
  edge_types publishes_to
  edge_types acknowledges
  state_types staged
  state_types live
  invariant OAuth credentials and tokens remain outside the repository and outside durable receipts
  invariant a live claim requires a Blogger API receipt and public URL
  forbidden_inference a staged article or callable adapter -> a published post
  forbidden_inference a Blogger connection -> authority to edit or delete remote content
  computational_form external_effect
  native_format html
  native_format json
  external_binding blogger-v3
  source_path bin/blogger_publish.py
  source_path components/BonfyreControlPlane/blogger_receipts.py
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_blogger_publish.py
  witness components/BonfyreControlPlane/tests/test_blogger_receipts.py
  source_lineage Generation-10 V8.1 External CMS / business systems profile
  known_gap live maturity remains below measured until OAuth consent yields retained Blogger response receipts and URLs
